Homepage: https://github.com/3vilM33pl3/buckets
Description: CLI tool for game asset and expectation management
 Buckets is a CLI tool for game asset and expectation management. It controls
 versions of work and sets/records expectations between collaborators. Each
 stage of the workflow is represented by a bucket containing resources to
 create game assets at specific production pipeline stages.
 .
 Features:
  - Version control for game assets
  - Bucket-based workflow management
  - File integrity checking with BLAKE3 hashing
  - Compression support with zstd
  - DuckDB-based data persistence
